msgstr "LF proporciona"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:132
msgid "When another SEO plugin is installed"
msgstr "Quan s'instal·la un altre plugin SEO"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:139
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/SeoTab.php:50
msgid "Hreflang"
msgstr "Hreflang"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:142
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:179
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:211
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:237
msgid "Disabled (by setting)"
msgstr "Desactivat (per configuració)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:145
msgid "✓ LF outputs — plugin hreflang suppressed"
msgstr "✓ Sortides LF — plugin hreflang suprimit"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:149
msgid "✓ LF outputs"
msgstr "✓ Sortides LF"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:155
msgid ""
"LF outputs accurate hreflang for every configured language, including x-"
"default. General SEO plugins have no access to your LF routing configuration "
"and would produce hreflang based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses "
"their output via filter to prevent collisions."
msgstr ""
"LF emet hreflang precís per a cada llengua configurada, incloent x-default. "
"Els plugins SEO generals no tenen accés a la configuració de rutes de LF i "
"produirien hreflang basat en suposicions d'URL incorrectes. LF suprimeix la "
"seva sortida mitjançant un filtre per evitar col·lisions."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of suppressed plugin names
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:163
#, php-format
msgid "Suppressed: %s."
msgstr "Sospès: %s."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:176
msgid "Open Graph"
msgstr "Open Graph"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:181
msgid "Disabled (mode setting)"
msgstr "Desactivat (per mode)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:184
msgid "→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin"
msgstr "→ Etiquetes de localització només — ajornant la base OG al plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:188
msgid "→ Locale tags only (manual setting)"
msgstr "→ Etiquetes de localització només (configuració manual)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:192
msgid "✓ LF outputs full OG + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "✓ Sortides LF — OG complet + Twitter Cards"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:198
msgid ""
"LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG "
"signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:"
"title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is "
"present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid "
"duplicate tags — not because the plugin is \"better\", but because "
"duplication produces no value."
msgstr ""
"LF sempre afegeix og:locale i og:locale:alternate — els senyals OG "
"multilingües que cap plugin SEO general pot produir correctament. Per al "
"conjunt OG base (og:title, og:description, og:image), LF ho emet quan cap "
"altre plugin està present. Quan s'instal·la un plugin SEO, LF salta el "
"conjunt base per evitar etiquetes duplicades — no perquè el plugin sigui "
"\"millor\", sinó perquè la duplicació no produeix valor."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:208
msgid "Schema.org JSON-LD"
msgstr "Schema.org JSON-LD"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:214
msgid "— Deferred to plugin"
msgstr "— D'atribució al plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:218
msgid "✓ LF outputs Article / WebPage / WebSite"
msgstr "✓ Sortides LF Article / WebPage / WebSite"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:224
msgid ""
"LF outputs multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations tied to its "
"language routing configuration. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF disables "
"its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors "
"and there is no clean way to supplement an existing graph."
msgstr ""
"LF emet JSON-LD multilingüe amb anotacions inLanguage vinculades a la seva "
"configuració de rutes de llengua. Quan s'instal·la un plugin SEO, LF "
"desactiva completament el seu esquema: gràfics JSON-LD duplicats que "
"produeixen errors de validació i no hi ha una manera neta de complementar un "
"gràfic existent."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:234
msgid "XML Sitemap"
msgstr "Mapa del lloc XML"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:240
msgid "✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml"
msgstr "✓ Actiu a /lf-sitemap.xml"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:246
msgid ""
"LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation "
"groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — "
"both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO "
"plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language "
"relationship signals."
msgstr ""
"LF genera el seu propi mapa del lloc amb alternants xhtml:link per a tots "
"els grups de traducció. Quan s'instal·la un plugin SEO, aquest genera un "
"mapa del lloc separat — ambdós coexisteixen de manera independent. Envia'ls "
"a Google Search Console: el mapa del lloc del plugin SEO per a la descoberta "
"de contingut, el mapa del lloc de LF per a senyals de relació de llengua."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:256
msgid "Canonical tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta canònica"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:260
msgid "✓ WP canonical replaced (self-referencing)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:263
msgid "WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)"
msgstr "Canonical del nucli de WP actiu (hreflang desactivat)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:268
msgid ""
"LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag and replaces it with a self-"
"referencing canonical pointing to the correct language-prefixed URL. When a "
"third-party SEO plugin (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) is active, LF "
"defers canonical management to that plugin entirely."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:281
msgid "Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin"
msgstr "Plugin mu legat lf-social-share"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:285
msgid "The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active."
msgstr "El plugin mu de social sharing lf està actiu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:287
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge's built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all "
"functionality the mu-plugin provides, plus multilingual og:locale support. "
"You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin."
msgstr ""
"Els mòduls integrats de Compartir Social i Open Graph de Lingua Forge "
"cobreixen tota la funcionalitat que proporciona el plugin mu, a més de "
"suport multilingüe per og:locale. Pots desactivar el plugin mu de manera "
"segura."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:294
msgid ""
"OG/Twitter Card tags: handled by LF's Open Graph module (SEO → Open Graph & "
"Twitter Cards)"
msgstr ""
"Etiquetes OG/Twitter Card: gestionades pel mòdul Open Graph de LF (SEO → "
"Open Graph & Twitter Cards)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:295
msgid ""
"Social Icons block share: URLs: handled by LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → "
"Social Share)"
msgstr ""
"Compartir bloc d'icones socials: URLs: gestionat pel Share Social integrat "
"de LF (SEO → Share Social)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:296
msgid "copy/native/auto JS actions: handled by LF's social-share.js"
msgstr "accions JS copy/native/auto: gestionat per LF's social-share.js"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:300
msgid ""
"While active, the mu-plugin handles the base OG set and LF emits locale tags "
"only (auto mode). Removing it switches LF to full OG mode automatically."
msgstr ""
"Mentre està actiu, el plugin mu gestiona el conjunt bàsic d'etiquetes OG i "
"LF emet només etiquetes de localització (mode automàtic). Eliminar-lo canvia "
"LF al mode OG complet automàticament."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:40
msgid "Debug Files"
msgstr "Arxius de depuració"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:44
msgid ""
"When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining "
"LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template "
"translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for "
"troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once "
"you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. "
"Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'activa el registre de depuració (mitjançant el commutador de baix o "
"definint LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG a wp-config.php), les funcions de traducció de "
"la plantilla i de traducció FSE escriuen les seves sol·licituds i respostes "
"d'AI en brut a disc per a la resolució de problemes. Utilitzeu aquesta "
"secció per monitoritzar aquesta sortida i esborrar-la un cop tingueu el que "
"necessiteu — els arxius poden créixer ràpidament en pàgines grans. "
"Configureu el directori de destinació mitjançant el filtre "
"linguaforge_debug_dir."

